```text
                    ViVu Mobile
                         │
              ┌──────────┴──────────┐
              │                     │
          MapLibre               Search
              │                     │
        OpenFreeMap /          Spring Boot
        Self-host tiles             │
                                    ▼
                                Photon /
                              Self-host Geo
                                   
                         Spring Boot
                              │
                              ▼
                      Python AI Service
                              │
          ┌───────────────────┼───────────────────┐
          ▼                   ▼                   ▼
   Place Provider       Routes Provider      Cost Engine
          │                   │
          ▼                   ▼
 Offline Catalog           OSRM
          │
          ▼
    Overpass fallback
          │
          ▼
        Cache
```

## Provider Strategy

```text
Places:
Offline → OSM/Overpass → optional Google

Routes:
OSRM → optional ORS/Google

Geocoding:
Photon → self-hosted provider

Map:
MapLibre → OpenFreeMap/self-hosted tiles
```

## Nguyên tắc dữ liệu

```text
Unknown ≠ 0
Estimate ≠ exact
Cache ≠ permanently accurate
OSM data ≠ Google Places data
```

Mọi dữ liệu bên ngoài cần lưu:

```text
source
retrieved_at
last_verified_at
is_estimate
```

